# These files run as shell scripts / get parsed by live-build inside WSL or
# a Linux box -- force LF regardless of core.autocrlf, otherwise Windows
# checkout injects \r and breaks the shebang line (same class of issue as
# the linux-6.12.41 repo's Windows git gotchas).
auto/* text eol=lf
config/**/*.chroot text eol=lf
config/**/*.conf text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
